      "tag_name": "v1.122.0",
      "description": "## Changelog   \n### ✨ Features   \n* 107b35dc: feat(api): detect Kiro terminal sessions (Himanshu Jha <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* daecf6fc: feat(api): support custom placeholder values (Radek Antoniuk <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* b479524a: feat(auth): add JSON output to auth status (Radek Antoniuk <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 172280be: feat(govern): sync Codex and Cursor sessions through the fallback job (Jean van der Walt <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 2568d1e5: feat(mr): move mr note create --draft and mr note publish to mr note draft (Andrei Zubov <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* ea2f2cfb: feat: add fallback periodic sync via launchd/systemd (Jean van der Walt <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 🐛 Bug Fixes   \n* 16e2204b: fix(deps): bump Go to 1.27.2 and golang.org/x/net to v0.60.0 (Jay McCure <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* bb929857: fix(git): validate API-supplied repository URLs before running git (Kai Armstrong <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 3d82843c: fix(govern): address review and testing follow-ups for fallback sync (Jean van der Walt <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 6acd6ea9: fix(iteration): show the real total in list header (unstable-code <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* bf5757bd: fix(snippet): keep create usage on a single line (Kai Armstrong <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 📝 Documentation   \n* c96c824f: docs: update Code of Conduct link in README (Ahmed Anwar <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 36694fb3: docs: update `glab stack` docs to clarify concepts and unify terminology (Uma Chandran <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 📦 Dependencies   \n* 2b7b1b5c: chore(deps): bump golangci-lint to v2.14.0 and fix new findings (Ahmed Hemdan <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 3b299de3: chore(deps): update module gitlab.com/gitlab-org/api/client-go/v3 to v3.16.0 (GitLab Renovate Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 12d0ec13: chore(deps): update module gitlab.com/gitlab-org/api/client-go/v3 to v3.16.1 (GitLab Dependency Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n* 9e934cea: chore(deps): update module gitlab.com/gitlab-org/api/client-go/v3 to v3.17.0 (GitLab Dependency Bot <redacted@example.invalid>)   \n### 🔧 Maintenance   \n* 688befec: ci: show the docs review environment only when docs change (Jay McCure <redacted@example.invalid>)\n\n",
